>  <SOURCE_REFERENCES>
["https://github.com/jensengroup/xyz2mol_tm/tree/db2734b084045ef895528c7a3d5040d38da23983/SMILES_csvs","https://github.com/uiocompcat/tmQM/tree/ece824419c9006fe66436daf233822b75533b82f/tmQM"]

>  <SELECTION_REASON>
Site-by-site g-xTB correction of ligand connectivity. The original same-ID connection table supports the corrected ligand skeleton. Site-specific g-xTB bond orders, distances and explicit valences support this connectivity; Formal charges follow the source representation of the same composition and balance the total charge. Localized 6 aromatic-ring bonds using WBOs and original bond lengths. Use the supplied Lewis representation for scoring; Independent evidence for the complete graph is limited.

